{
  "$note": [
    "Corpus for the tier-1 physical-description pick differential (P4.D283, v4 9ecebf986).",
    "Read by BOTH sides: harness/oracle/cases/physical-description.ts drives v4's real",
    "pickPhysicalDescription / hasPhysicalDescription (lib/characters/physical-description.ts),",
    "and crates/quilltap-harness/tests/physical_description_equivalence.rs drives v5's",
    "quilltap_core::characters::physical_description over the same `desc` objects.",
    "",
    "Every `desc` is run under ALL FIVE profiles (head-and-shoulders, full-length, scene,",
    "self-image, fullest); a row is emitted per (case, profile) with `pick` and `has`.",
    "",
    "One sentinel: a `desc` of \"__UNDEFINED__\" means the argument is JS `undefined`",
    "(v4's `if (!desc) return ''`); `null` is passed as null. Shapes pinned: every variant",
    "present; each variant alone (so every profile's lead AND its tail show); whitespace-only",
    "leads that must be SKIPPED (the pre-span `||` chains took them as truthy); trailing /",
    "leading whitespace and newlines that must be TRIMMED off the winner (the system",
    "prompt's bytes move on this); JS-whitespace edges beyond ASCII (NBSP, the ideographic",
    "space, a BOM, the line/paragraph separators — JS `trim` strips them all); an empty",
    "string; interior whitespace kept; an empty object; and the head-and-shoulders crop",
    "alone, which `scene` / `self-image` / `fullest` must NEVER answer."
  ],
